Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.03,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The others didn't need to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:12.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They're not fond of formal meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:19.87,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.37,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:26.58,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.43,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Kyle, what is the—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:03.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:41.67,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Demons...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:49.10,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,The species controlling the rest of Leunders\Nand the bane of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:55.77,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,They number far fewer than humanoids, \Nbut individually, they are far stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:03:01.53,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Currently, not a single nation knows \Nexactly what the demons are up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:09.54,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Three centuries without an attack has been\N plenty of time to let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:15.34,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Hardly anyone now has ever \Nseen a demon in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:18.80,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,But I'm more than familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:23.55,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,That horn on her head and that\N unique intimidating presence...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.63,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,She's humankind's greatest foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.29,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,A demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:53.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Looks like that worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Care to taste a few more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:03:59.32,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I don't have my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.21,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I left Sildonia behind too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:03.09,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can't use much magic either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.01,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I've been careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:08.66,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I never would've screwed up \Nlike this during the Great Invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.64,Default,GUARD B,0,0,0,,Hey! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:11.35,Default,GUARD C,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.83,Default,GUARD A,0,0,0,,What's this about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:14.35,Default,MAID,0,0,0,,It's Lord Alzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.20,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,She actually ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:27.24,Default,GUARDS,0,0,0,,Hey! Summon the other soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:29.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Alzard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:36.70,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,After that, more than half the soldiers \Nand officials at the empire's embassy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.31,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,were found brutally murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:48.01,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Strangely, none of the survivors witnessed\N anything or even heard a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:53.02,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I've made months' worth\N of progress today alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:56.02,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Your knowledge is incredible, Sildonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:59.20,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You're not bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:02.78,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's impressive you've learned \Nso much at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:07.29,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,How old are you, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.79,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.54,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Tea's ready. Why don't you take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.40,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.65,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to clean up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:24.69,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine. I'm used to looking \Nafter Kyle and Theron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:26.30,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Thanks a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:29.30,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,By the way, where {\i1}is{\i0} Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.49,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,At lunch with a man from the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:35.91,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We're not much for formal meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.06,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Aw, man. What a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:43.43,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Sorry. My father's been out since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:45.32,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.57,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Wait, I know. Have {\i1}you{\i0} heard anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:54.62,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,He was acting like he knew something\Nabout a sword comparable to Kyle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:01.59,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Maybe he meant the Holy Sword Rand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.77,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The Holy Sword Rand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:04.34,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:11.27,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,It was forged in Karan two millennia ago \Nby a dwarf heralded as an extraordinary smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:15.85,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,They say Randolph the hero used it \Nto defeat the demon king of his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:20.85,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,The sword was dubbed \N"Holy Sword Rand" after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:25.01,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,It's supposedly in the city right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.86,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,My father says he saw it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That sounds kind of awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:38.62,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,If it really is in Karan, then it's probably \Nin the possession of Governor Bax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:42.23,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.23,0:06:44.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That sounds perfect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:51.83,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Except it's a state treasure,\Nso I doubt they'd let just anyone have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:56.58,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Uh, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.50,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Goh, does anyone have it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:06.02,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,As you know, I had that dispute \Nwith those debt collectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.82,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The house is surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.53,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'd say just under ten men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.39,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,And this bloodlust...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:14.60,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,They're stronger than\Nthe ruffians from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are they here for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.55,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Well, we'll know once we capture 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:23.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll handle most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:27.07,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But some might still make it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:30.20,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I-Is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.05,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You can bet on what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:36.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He's got a real nose for this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.77,0:07:38.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,And {\i1}only{\i0} this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Goh, you hide in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.44,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,S-Surely there's something I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:46.31,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,An amateur won't be of much use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:48.56,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You should hide with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:50.06,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:54.76,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,You're so calm, Sildonia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.13,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Ask Kyle to pay for a new door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Oh, you're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:23.30,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Caught someone to torture \Nuntil he spills the beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Man, I feel like this is all I do lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:33.72,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You guys should run if you don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.49,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, you might get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:45.34,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That's berrada poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.00,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,A single scratch will immobilize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.50,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:54.26,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,Remain calm during battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.45,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.26,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh no! I went overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.85,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I was hoping to question him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:27.42,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Well, Urza will figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:35.09,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,An undine's body is made of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:38.34,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Neither daggers nor poisons \Nare effective against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:49.37,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I may have gone a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:53.32,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Thank you, undine. I appreciate the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.24,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:03.06,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Hey, you didn't go much easier than I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:04.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,He'd better be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:08.55,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I mean... I think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:18.01,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:20.25,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.47,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.90,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,You're both pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:26.89,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Why are you standing so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:28.77,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.77,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,All finished in here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:36.78,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:41.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell us who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:44.18,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why did you attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.91,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'd recommend you talk, for your own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:51.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,These ladies behind me \Nare professional torturers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:59.81,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The redhead can turn any common \Nhousehold item into a torture device.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.43,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:02.68,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:05.18,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Even ladles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:11.19,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She'll slice you up good all over\Nand rub irritant in each and every wound
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:15.32,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,so she can enjoy your endless screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:21.52,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But don't go thinking you can\Ntake the easy way out by croaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:24.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We've got loads of healing potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.88,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Not to mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:32.15,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The elf woman is skilled at keeping \Npeople just short of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:37.38,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She'll feed you healing potions just \Nas your consciousness begins to fade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:40.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,all so she can prolong\N your suffering, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:46.13,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Eventually, you'd beg me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.32,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,to put you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.65,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But I'm not a cruel man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:58.15,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You may be my enemy, but I couldn't\N bear to hand you over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.04,Default,LIESE & URZA,0,0,0,,We're killing {\i1}you{\i0} later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:06.03,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So if you answer me honestly, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:08.16,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll even pay for your getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.91,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But make the call quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:16.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We have others I'm sure\N would be happy to take your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:25.69,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,W-We were just hired to kidnap that Goh kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:27.51,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,A kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:31.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You seemed awful bloodthirsty for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:35.27,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,We were told we could kill \Nanyone who got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:39.06,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I've been hearing rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:42.93,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,They say missing persons \Nin Karan have been on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:47.41,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,It's not yet known if foul play is involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.69,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,People are going missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:53.66,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Is that why Miranda had so many guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.92,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What happens to the folks getting nabbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.44,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:00.63,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,We were just told to take them\Nto an empty house outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:04.55,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Either way, I can't believe\Nyou'd strike in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.46,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,We were always discreet in the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:10.80,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,But you're outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.55,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,Who'd care if we came straight for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:15.18,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:18.06,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The guards still haven't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:30.70,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,All right, so who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.32,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,I don't know! Honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:36.03,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,We've already kidnapped a few people, \Nbut nothing's come of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:38.08,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,They're probably covering it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:41.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Which means your employer is fairly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:45.22,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't know who it is, but it might be—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:46.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:47.46,Default,ATTACKER A,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.57,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.81,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah. All good over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:00.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Let's go after them. Whoever's behind this—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:01.37,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:04.86,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.74,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I haven't encountered anyone\Nthis dangerous in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:11.98,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You're not giving chase?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.21,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:21.13,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I haven't felt anything like that\Nsince seeing my mom at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:25.65,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I suppose I should commend your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:29.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,That spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.45,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,was undoubtedly the work of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.67,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The situation is grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:44.15,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The damage is extensive, but the \Ndiplomatic issues cannot be ignored either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.94,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You people know what happened, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:50.78,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle was injured. \NSurely you don't think he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:56.41,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,He's been cleared of suspicion, \Nbut the real problem is the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:15:00.35,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,They'll insist we're consorting with demons
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:03.62,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,and issue all manner of rebukes against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:11.30,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I know Kyle saw a demon at the embassy, \Nbut are we sure one came after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:16.14,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed. That destructive magic \Nis unique to demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:21.31,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,They're unsubtle with their spells \Nbecause they have so much magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:27.01,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,And if they're involved, \Nthen in the worst case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:31.85,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,they could blow the entire city off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:39.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to go \Nafter the demons right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:46.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, we should confirm whether Governor Bax\Nis really involved with the kidnappings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:50.97,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Miranda, you knew about\N the kidnappings, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.14,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.97,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,We were only recently able \Nto confirm they were happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:00.79,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Do you know who's responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:05.48,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,No. They're covering their tracks well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:10.99,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I won't deny it's possible the governor\Nis involved in the kidnappings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:19.54,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,But I can't make sense of him condoning\Nsuch crimes in his own city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.50,Default,EMBASSY STAFF,0,0,0,,Terrible news! The governor's mansion...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:25.73,Default,EMBASSY STAFF,0,0,0,,The governor's mansion is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.18,Default,DWARVES,0,0,0,,Someone lend me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.01,Default,DWARVES,0,0,0,,Heave ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:36.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They beat us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:40.64,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It burned right to the ground. Unnaturally so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:45.13,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,A fire now, of all times?\NThere's no way that's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:50.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I picked through the rubble\Nbut didn't find the Holy Sword Rand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:53.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't be a looter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:55.28,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I came up empty-handed as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You can't find the governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.14,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:01.85,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,We haven't even located his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:04.79,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,even though he was gravely ill and bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:07.70,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Did demons do this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:10.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, that seems unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.32,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:17.70,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If arson were among their methods, \Nthey would've employed it at the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:21.58,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Then if demons didn't set this fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:26.06,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Our prime suspect is the governor,\Nwho is still unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:28.93,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If he were the mastermind\N behind the kidnappings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:33.57,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,it would make sense that he'd start \Nthe fire to destroy evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:37.31,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Either way, we must uncover his whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:43.35,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,She's so dependable at times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:49.90,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,The Miranda I knew was a key figure \Nin keeping our allies supplied and informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:54.18,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,But she could be callous.\N She wasn't as genial as she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.09,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,What an awful situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:00.97,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Goh! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:03.79,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We told you to wait with the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:07.60,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Sorry. I heard there was \Na fire and got worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:10.72,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're worried about the governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:15.74,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,No. My father was summoned\N by one of his messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.85,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,What? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:20.15,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I think he might've come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.15,0:18:22.49,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why would the governor summon Gazus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:24.68,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:29.93,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Does this have anything to do\Nwith Gazus being a candidate for governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:34.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If so, maybe Bax is behind\N the kidnappings after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:38.37,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,M-Miranda?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:40.51,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Th-This is all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:46.77,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I'm the one who nominated him\N to be the next governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:49.77,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.50,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I dragged someone so important into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:55.65,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If anything happens to him, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.78,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,M-Miranda, we don't know\N it's come to that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:05.00,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,What's going on? Why is Miranda so distraught?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:12.50,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,You think I'm cold, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.49,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,N-No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:16.29,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:20.74,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I wasn't always like this, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.19,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I had a lover once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:25.31,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:31.51,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,But he died because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:36.37,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,After that, I gave up on love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:40.05,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I decided to become heartless and calculating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:45.91,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,The lover she mentioned back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.45,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Was it Gazus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:56.30,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,You didn't know they were romantically involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:58.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah, we had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:05.58,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,My dad's hard to get along with at first, \Nbut he's nice once you get to know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:10.68,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Things have been awkward lately, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:14.63,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I think my father was avoiding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:16.17,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:20.69,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,So Miranda would do things like \Ncome over to feed me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:23.20,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Like she was trying to score points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.78,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Score points?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:31.35,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I mean, with Miranda's personality, \Nshe probably thinks this is her last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:33.39,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Better not say that to her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:43.61,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,If her lover in my previous life was Gazus, \Nthis must be the incident where he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:47.81,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I have to think back.\NWas there anything else of note?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:53.31,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Hey, you'll catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.71,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,This is why I can't stand drunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.78,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:04.20,Flashback,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If only I'd found that \Nunderground passage sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.45,0:21:13.84,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What's up, Kyle? You donned your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm going to the governor's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.80,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I just realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Urza, I'd like to borrow your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:24.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:26.00,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.36,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then I'll tag along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:32.10,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I haven't given up on the Holy Sword Rand yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:35.10,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I-I want in too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:36.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:40.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Goh, look after Miranda until we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:42.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't leave the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:44.24,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:47.77,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,If what Miranda said was for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:53.39,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,then all the answers lie through\Nthat hidden underground passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}Hidden Ambitions
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:39.18,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "Hidden Ambitions."
